 Four days will quickly steep themselves in night. Four nights will quickly dream away the time.\n**Enter Egeus, Hermia, Lysander and Demetrius.**\nEgeus: Happy be Theseus, our renownèd duke!\nTheseus: Thanks, good Egeus. What's the news with thee?","compositions":[{"compositionId":1,"level":1.0,"speedFactor":1.0,"restart":false}],"keys":[],"looks":[],"moves":[],"sections":[]},{"number":"3","name":"The forest at night","cueNote":"GO on Puck's entrance","delayMs":0,"script":"**A wood near Athens. Night. Enter a Fairy at one door and Puck at another.**\nPuck: How now, spirit! Whither wander you?\nFairy: Over hill, over dale, thorough bush, thorough brier. I do wander everywhere, swifter than the moon's sphere.\n//## Moonrise (the moon comes up behind the trees)##\nPuck: The king doth keep his revels here tonight. Take heed the queen come not within his sight.\n**Thunder. Enter Oberon with his train, and Titania with hers.**\nOberon: Ill met by moonlight, proud Titania.\nTitania: What, jealous Oberon? Fairies, skip hence.","compositions":[{"compositionId":2,"level":1.0,"speedFactor":1.0,"restart":false}],"keys":[{"slot":1,"compositionId":6,"mode":"flash","fadeMs":0}],"looks":[],"moves":[{"moveId":2}],"sections":[{"marker":"Moonrise","compositions":[{"compositionId":2,"level":1.0,"speedFactor":1.0,"restart":false},{"compositionId":3,"level":0.5,"speedFactor":1.0,"restart":false}],"looks":[],"moves":[{"moveId":2}]}]},{"number":"3.5","name":"Puck appears","cueNote":"Visual: Puck jumps from the tree","delayMs":0,"script":"","compositions":[{"compositionId":2,"level":1.0,"speedFactor":1.0,"restart":false},{"compositionId":5,"level":1.0,"speedFactor":1.0,"restart":false}],"keys":[{"slot":1,"compositionId":6,"mode":"flash","fadeMs":0}],"looks":[],"moves":[],"sections":[]},{"number":"4","name":"Sunrise","cueNote":"GO when the lovers lie down","fadeInMs":8000,"delayMs":0,"script":"**Dawn. The lovers lie asleep on the ground.**\nTheseus: Go, bid the huntsmen wake them with their